No. It records a decision, not the goal.
answer end
paragraph end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-decided-writers
Decided. Only the text editor, the website and the notation
system write. Every writer saves automatically. Auto save is
step 9.
contract start
id: q575f3b
question: Can the goal be stated as one outcome, not an activity?
contract end
answer start
for: q575f3b
asked: Can the goal be stated as one outcome, not an activity?
No. It records a decision, not the goal.
answer end
paragraph end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-decided-scale
Decided. Scale: the index loads in parts. Only the boxes on
screen plus a margin around it are drawn, so scrolling stays
fast. It uses what the machine has: phone now, laptop later.
