chapter start
name: section-done-when
title start
name: title-done-when
Done when
title end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-from-the-cli
From the CLI one command returns the backlinks of a block. A browser
shows the mind map from the index with no round trip per click. An
edit through a live link changes the source file and the map updates
by itself.
contract start
id: qd95f0b
question: Could someone check this without asking the author?
contract end
answer start
for: qd95f0b
asked: Could someone check this without asking the author?
Partly. The CLI check is exact, the browser checks need a named page.

answer end
